%description:

Tcp.initialWindow:rfc2001-restart -- after an idle period longer than the RTO, the next flight has one segment.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "the initial window ... "rfc2001": one segment"; RFC 5681 section
4.1: after an idle period longer than the RTO, the window restarts at min(IW, cwnd).

The class rfc2001-restart: TcpAlgorithmBase::sendData() restarts the window after an idle
period longer than the RTO, at one segment for "rfc2001" and at min(IW, cwnd) for the other
values. This facet comes from the coverage gap loop: no test reached the code of this part. This test separates "rfc2001" from "rfc3390" (3 segments) and "rfc6928".

Host under test: host1; host1 sends 30000 bytes at 0.2 s and 30000 bytes at 3 s. Observation:
level 1, host1 sends one data segment after 3 s before the first ACK of the new data.

%# parameter: Tcp.initialWindow
%# class: rfc2001-restart
%# value: "rfc2001"
%# key: *.host1.tcp.initialWindow
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpInitialWindowRfc2001Restart")
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == true && tcp.ackBit == false")
             .capture("isn", "tcp.sequenceNo")
             .describe("the SYN of host1")
             .within(0.5))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.ackNo == {isn} + 1 + 30000")
             .describe("the ACK of the first 30000 bytes")
             .within(2.0))
        .meanwhile(anyNumberOfTimes(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
                                        .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == false && pk.dataLength > tcp.headerLength")
                                        .captureCount("flight")
                                        .describe("each data segment of host1 after the idle period")
                                        .within(4.0)))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.ackNo > {isn} + 1 + 30000")
             .first()
                  .assertPacket("{flight} == 1")
             .describe("the first ACK of the new data")
             .within(3.0));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpInitialWindowRfc2001Restart compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.initialWindow = "rfc2001"    # the parameter under test
*.linkDelay = 10ms
*.host1.app[0].sendScript = "0.2 30000; 3 30000"
*.host1.app[0].sendBytes = 0B
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpInitialWindowRfc2001Restart: PASS
